      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pad\"><div class=\"ds-pad__k\"><small>STÜCKZAHL · ANTIPPEN</small><strong>1'200</strong><span>von 1'200 · 100 %</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pad{background:#0a1220;padding:24px}.ds-pad__k{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#111d31,#0d1726);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:22px;padding:20px 24px;color:#eaf1fb;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;box-shadow:0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);transition:transform .12s,box-shadow .12s;cursor:pointer}.ds-pad__k:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}.ds-pad__k small{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8b9db8}.ds-pad__k strong{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-pad__k span{color:#8b9db8;font-size:.9rem}"
